      "fix": "Replace numeric spacing with `theme.spacing * n` (e.g., `theme.spacing * 3`) and ensure horizontal padding of 16 dp is applied via the `Screen` container."
    },
    {
      "severity": "medium",
      "file": "src/components/ui/PrimaryButton.tsx",
