    },
    {
      "element": "Form fields (Amount, Date, Category, Notes)",
      "issue": "Labels sit inside as static placeholders, so once a value is typed the field loses its name; gaps between fields are inconsistent (24 / 16 / 8) and there is no reserved space for HelperText, so the layout will jump on validation errors.",
      "fix": "Create src/components/ui/FormField.tsx wrapping <TextInput mode=\"outlined\" label={label} dense={false} /> plus <HelperText type=\"error\" visible={!!error} padding=\"none\"> that always renders (min height 20). Give the wrapper marginBottom: 16 and remove ad-hoc margins from the screen. Amount: keyboardType=\"decimal-pad\", left={<TextInput.Affix text=\"$\" />}.",
