      "element": "\"Save receipt\" button",
      "issue": "Disabled grey pill sits inline in the scroll content with only 8px above it; on desktop it floats mid-page and on phone it can scroll out of reach, and the disabled state gives no reason why.",
      "fix": "Add src/components/ui/FormFooter.tsx: a View pinned to the bottom with backgroundColor theme.colors.surface, borderTopWidth 1 / borderTopColor outlineVariant, padding 16 + useSafeAreaInsets().bottom, containing <Button mode=\"contained\" style={{width:'100%'}} contentStyle={{height:48}} loading={saving} disabled={!valid || saving}>Save receipt</Button>. Use it on Receipt and Mileage entry screens.",
      "shared": true
