      "element": "\"Add photo\" control",
      "issue": "A full-width outlined button with blue text reads as another input field and gives no preview slot for the chosen image.",
      "fix": "Replace with a photo tile: Pressable Surface, height 120, borderRadius theme.roundness*2, borderWidth 1 dashed theme.colors.outlineVariant, centered Icon \"camera-plus\" (28) over <Text variant=\"labelLarge\">Add photo</Text> in onSurfaceVariant; when a photo exists show the Image filling the tile with a small Icon button \"close\" top-right. marginBottom: 24.",
